{{Wireless embedded system |brand=Tenda |model=FH303 |revision=v2 |asin=B00CTJOT3O |manuf_country=China |is_manuf=Yes |availability=now |fcc_date=08/13/2013 |fcc_id=V7TFH303V2 |type=wireless router |pwr_v=9 |pwr_amp=1 |pwr_conn=barrel |cpu1_brand=Broadcom |cpu1_model=BCM5357C0;BCM5357C0KFBG, HE1343 P30, 330121-06 01B W; |cpu1_cspeed=300 |fla1=4 |fla1_brand=GigaDevice |fla1_model=GD25Q32BSIG |ram1=32 |ram1_brand=Winbond |ram1_model=W9425G6JH-5 |expansion_if_types= |expansion_usb_num= |jtag= |serial=yes,, 4-pin header,, 3.3V TTL,, (115200 8N1) |wi1_chip1_brand=Broadcom |wi1_chip1_model=BCM5357C0 |wi1_802dot11_protocols=bgn |wi1_ant_conn= |wi1_txchains=2 |wi1_rxchains=3 |wi1_sstreams=2 |eth_cpu=true |sw_cpu=true |lan_speed=100M |lan_ports=3 |wan_speed=100M |wan_ports=1 |addl_chips=2.4GHz Power Amplifier IC;Skyworks;SE2605L;SKY, 2605L, 151AJ;2; |stock_boot=CFE;5.100.138.3; |stock_os=eCos;5.110.27.21; |tp_firmware= |802dot11_protocols=bgn |default_ssid=Tenda_XXXXXX |default_ssid_regex=^Tenda [A-F0-9]{6}$ |default_ip=192.168.0.1 |default_user= |default_pass=admin |oui=C8:3A:35 |oui_eth=C8:3A:35 }} {{TagLine|Wireless N300 High Power Router}} :{{ProductPage|http://www.tendacn.com/tendacn/Product/show.aspx?productid{{!!}}438}}
"10016298" and "V2.0" (FCC EUT) or "V2.1" <!--(some / all current production models)--> is silkscreened on the board. :Two [http://www.skyworksinc.com/Product.aspx?ProductID=964 '''Skyworks''' SE2605L] PAMs are in use :.. as well as two ICs marked w/ (at least) S318 (7446)
The power adapter shown in the FCC external photos is a :'''Shenzhen Heweishun Network Technology Co, Ltd.''' :TEA09U-09100 (100-240VAC ~ 50/60Hz, 0.3A -> 9VDC, 1.0A).
===Links=== *[https://forum.openwrt.org/viewtopic.php?id=49029 On the '''OpenWrt''' forums] :eCos would seem to be the stock OS
